  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.26 - FINAL STABLE RELEASE (January 2026)\n- NEW: Added 'name', 'path', 'type' as standard variables inside components\n- FIX: Resolved variable leaking between sibling components in OnBeforeIncludeRender callbacks using snapshot/restore\n- FIX: Enabled interpolation within 'name' attribute of components\n- FIX: Nested property access in Params (e.g., {{element.Class}}) now resolves correctly using callback context\n- Optimized: Local resolution context/syncing for better isolation and performance",
